{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625170/extras/8d77d2f31fbc61c92af4b0c17020f98a.webp?t=1760744042\" width=600 height=57 /></span><strong>About the game:</strong> Skull Seeker is an adventure puzzle game in which you play as an explorer in a fascinating, puzzle-filled world. Your goal is to explore mysterious lands, solve complex environmental puzzles, and discover hidden secrets that will bring you closer to solving the greatest mystery - the ancient Skull.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1625170/extras/72ee22a76995f8172a75d8127d271a5d.avif?t=1760744042\" width=400 height=281 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open world exploration</strong>: Open world exploration: Freely move through diverse and picturesque locations full of secrets and interactions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental puzzles</strong>: Environmental puzzles: Use your logical thinking skills to solve puzzles and unlock further paths.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized 3D graphics</strong>: Enjoy colorful and atmospheric graphics that combine charm and mystery.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relaxing gameplay</strong>: Immerse yourself in a peaceful world full of adventures, perfect for solving puzzles at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Single player gameplay</strong>: Perfect for players who like to explore virtual worlds on their own and discover their secrets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Explore three islands and ancient dungeons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=